{"unit_id":"xcw520__dsh-dania-voice#card-zh","repo":"xcw520/dsh-dania-voice","commit":"14f69881305c60de6b77e487706b800029e293da","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-dania-voice**（DSH 网页插件）：在浏览器里用本地 GPT-SoVITS 为助手回复生成达妮娅语音，并通过可拖动挂件控制开关。插件监听 DSH 会话事件，清洗 Markdown、把长回复切段后发送给本机语音服务，再由网页端轮询并播放缓存的 WAV。主要功能包括自动朗读助手回复、可选朗读用户消息、音量语速与采样参数调节、重复上一轮回复和一键安装语音引擎。适合希望在 DSH 网页会话中听取回复并在本机合成语音的用户。使用需本机 Python 3.10–3.12 和约 5 GB 磁盘空间；首次设置会下载 GPT-SoVITS、推理依赖及语音模型，不需要 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:684-723","index.js:581-617","client.js:178-206","scripts/install.mjs:232-257"]}
{"unit_id":"xcw520__dsh-dania-voice#card-en","repo":"xcw520/dsh-dania-voice","commit":"14f69881305c60de6b77e487706b800029e293da","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-dania-voice reads DSH replies aloud with local GPT-SoVITS. A draggable mascot controls playback; it cleans and segments text, queues WAV audio, and offers voice controls, replay, and one-click setup. It requires Python 3.10–3.12 and 5 GB for engine and models; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:684-723","index.js:581-617","client.js:178-206","scripts/install.mjs:232-257"]}
