{"unit_id":"xcw520__dsh-dania-voice#feature-clean","repo":"xcw520/dsh-dania-voice","commit":"14f69881305c60de6b77e487706b800029e293da","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-dania-voice** 的功能「回复转语音」：监听 DSH 会话中的助手消息，在一轮结束时收集文本并交给本地 GPT-SoVITS 合成。Host 将 WAV 放入队列，浏览器端取回并播放。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:684-713","index.js:581-617","index.js:846-873"]}
