{"unit_id":"xcw520__dsh-dania-voice#caveat-local","repo":"xcw520/dsh-dania-voice","commit":"14f69881305c60de6b77e487706b800029e293da","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-dania-voice 使用前须知：助手文本会通过 HTTP POST 发送到本机 127.0.0.1:9880 的 GPT-SoVITS /tts 接口；首次部署还会从外部模型仓库下载引擎和模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:591-617","scripts/install.mjs:37-52","scripts/install.mjs:54-55"]}
